                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْمُولٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>An iron style with which one writes on
tablets.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The <i>style,</i> or <i>bodkin, with which
collyrium is applied to the eyes.</i> (S, K.) In the
CK, incorrectly, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْمُولٌ</span>: the former is found in
MS. copies of the K, as well as in the S, and is
right accord. to the TK.

